<!--
  Notification status-bar icon. Android renders small icons as a monochrome alpha silhouette
  (white on transparent) and strips all color — the launcher's tilted, dotted "A." reads fine at
  launcher size but was reported illegible at real 24dp notification scale (misread as crossed
  arrows). This is a plain upright bold "A" (no tilt, no dot) sized to fill the canvas so it stays
  unambiguous even after OS anti-aliasing/tinting.
-->
